The image that docker/Dockerfile.train-flux3 builds contains the FLUX 3 Action DROID policy (/opt/flux3/droid)
and the trunk and video VAE of FLUX 3 Action Base (/opt/flux3/base), from Black Forest Labs Inc. The FLUX
Kommunity License v1.0 governs them. The image holds a copy of the licence at /opt/flux3/droid/LICENSE.md. The
same text is at
https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-action-droid/blob/3d0887bdc7acee1686b19afac267125d519ff4f1/LICENSE.md.
Black Forest Labs Inc. grants any rights to use the FLUX Model directly to you, under that licence. The model
cards are /opt/flux3/droid/README.md and /opt/flux3/base/README.md.

Positronic did not change the model weights. This image is not an official product of Black Forest Labs Inc.
Black Forest Labs Inc. did not endorse, approve or validate it.

The image also contains:
- Black Forest Labs' FLUX Action code, under the Apache License 2.0: /opt/flux-action/LICENSE and
  /opt/flux-action/NOTICE.
- Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct, the text encoder, as an unmodified copy under the Apache License 2.0. Its model
  card is /opt/flux3/base/text_encoder/README.md.
- Positronic's scripts that start a training run, under the Apache License 2.0, in /opt/train. The
  licence is /opt/train/LICENSE.
